The elections for the Technical Advisory Board will be held today
(Wednesday November 2nd) at 5:15pm after the last microconference.

All attendees of Linux Plumbers as well as Kernel Summit may come and
vote. The current candidates are:

  Josh Triplett
  Rik van Riel
  Dave Taht
  Chris Mason (incumbent)
  Dan Williams
  Alexei Starovoitov
  Martin K. Petersen
  Olof Johansson

Each of these candidates submitted a statement for why they believe
they should be a member of the TAB. Please read their statements here
before you vote.

  http://goo.gl/QpIMTX


